{"ref":"BDB, עֲבוֹט","hw":"עֲבוֹט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבוֹט</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>pledge, article pledged</strong> as security for debt;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.11\">Dt 24:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.13\">13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹטוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.10\">10</a> (as acc. cogn.), v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.12\">12</a>.","next":"BDB, עַבְטִיט","prev":"BDB, עבט"}